  "note": "Arithmetic on weight shapes, not a measurement. free_exact_reduction is the cache reduction obtainable with zero training and zero quality loss, because rank(W_KV) <= min(2*n_kv*head_dim, hidden). At rank = hidden this is equivalent to caching the layer input instead of K and V, which is a known trick, not a finding. No weights loaded, no sealed data, no gate opened.",
